4295/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 497, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 372, "last_played": 1630201929, "avatar": "5893b686c6db6ab1cdc3bdf7d49ff31f9df4897c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Very fun game with friends, love the challenge that it offers, the constant swarm of aliens and the damn face ♥♥♥♥♥♥♥ that kill you so fast. Would rate this 8/10 for the lack of missions which is expected from a free to play game and how the leveling only unlocks weapons and equipment and does nothing else special. Over all great game.", "timestamp_created": 1557553512, "timestamp_updated": 1557553512, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1279569600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "50526266", "author": {"steamid": "76561198027708122", "personaname": "Abyssal Queen", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/abyssal_queen/", "num_games_owned": 433, "num_reviews": 79, "playtime_forever": 673, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 673, "last_played": 1479785106, "avatar": "527680b059b3637302f733039f8c4cd44fca5e6c"}, "language": "english", "review": "Kinda feels like a twin stick shooter version of Starcraft, where you play as the Terrans and the enemies are all Zerg (Zerg Rush included!).  Its quite fun, though the later levels can be more then just challenging if your group doesn't know what to do.  Game can be played solo with AI team mates, but they seem to be to stupid to survive past the first few levels, and unfortunately they can't be used in Workshop maps (that I'm aware of at least), so having friends to play with is highly recommended (and since the game is free that shouldn't be to hard).", "timestamp_created": 1557232118, "